f_then' mini-stacks useful for modular 3-D code select/duplicate/move/delete</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="xt[Ud3tsPYxpxFb-xf}|"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="nZ72~(JxoE.N}0xeIbFz"><field name="TEXT">Light_Gray Functions non-editable (backend staff-use code only)</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="1_uRi+yLA#Kvi{d}d2qz"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id=")!/v%:2+pMeT}`fKbX`+"><field name="TEXT">For Group_CHannel_# (Bot_Id): Propose: 1-10 Staff Use, 11-99 Student Use</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="4Ei0%QxLz*siWsYcNi@x"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="3|IqJ%U8chbhx4xFeWaU"><field name="TEXT">SW Reset: Long_Press Logo for 3 sec min</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="u{Ex#@a(b;6Fgt_`djrQ"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="^:j0fMET/=k3ufozauN^"><field name="TEXT">Built-in Diagnostic Test: Short_Press Logo for 1 sec max</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="`/P51]E}s0GMEt+lf-+*"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="y{ekye|!E6([kZ6vMx|u"><field name="TEXT">'Blocks' Window homes 'on start'_stack as top_left corner of editor_screen, until 'on start' is moved below, then next stack to right presides</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="b`Le$mYjO{5JvRd5em3x"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="a`L.~rD=Ntiyzqk{gl4@"><field name="TEXT">All These Levels are Intermediate Level Coding due to Networking Pairing Involved.  Basic Diagnostic Servo_Motors (Autonomoous) is Beginner Level.</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="hcbKtOrE7D8wh5UD]yWa"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="bzI$tG};:kJcsR-VahA8"><field name="TEXT">This Intermediate Level Network_Pairing has 1sec_Lag Response Time; The Other Advanced Level Network_Pairing has Real_Time Response Time.</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="hu._B+*pWeQRwS1S.|M["><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="9iz6btl4O_?qUan!B9_x"><field name="TEXT">For Level 1, can keep 'Forward: set manual_servo_motors' Block functional, yet reset to 0 all other 'set manual_servo_motors' Blocks for Discovery Learning</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_3_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="P,*|b9,}HTw[UExW,0)y"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="f|g~qev4hD5zR#bQitVQ"><field name="TEXT">If duplicate stacks exist, then the highest stack is active and others are non_active</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="BUs(3:L/K;bPq8,tMxqL"><value name="IF0"><shadow type="logic_boolean" id="g:IMG6$18$=*18L86:rS"><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></shadow></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="quest_Note_6_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Big_Func" id="p7AZPLP5aoFK)EJ;t5GB"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id=",+_jcB84Rx$HCC+!Eo;L"><field name="TEXT">Staff: Important Notes</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="x}lMrXGB~=`$u8U{FJ@h"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="L,%KhXfF*%2X?BnS+td["><field name="TEXT">Upon open file, Editor zooms in on closest stack to right of original_origin from project_creation</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="Y.yekmO6/DV}2!C9!c%3"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="p38i6@BCH2MFJA9v,#2d"><field name="TEXT">Semantic Naming prefers '_' vs. '-' since latter can be conufused with minus_sign</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="K~1,LTQ1i(MQ2kR:c/@u"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="}8lw;.(uf|?VuNM.$NaO"><field name="TEXT">'every 360000 ms' (1 hour) Stacks can be ignored, esp w/ 'if false' embedded</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="+tz).!LqqV,tE]RZ%jFP"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="AiQg8DO-cd#}Myw[p58c"><field name="TEXT">Avoid using 'show leds' Block since will cause lag &amp; degrade real-time response</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="-}0a5P1u^T18mRUdknKh"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="%Z6`8FFk()mrY=qv8.?$"><field name="TEXT">Seems like 'signficant' changes to JavaScript can activate 'format code', rearrange stacks to original position</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="Xc[aI{Eg:P`;Ph=}7wl6"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="nt3yAcJri3J5bk_D+VMd"><field name="TEXT">Important 'system' variables are 1) _system_Hw_DeviceType__* (Hw=Hardware) and 2) _system_Sw_ModeState__* (Sw=Software)</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="W6vlL!1K5t7km,%MrfN/"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="T})0EQ6I+DBpjQZ-G(/)"><field name="TEXT">If Buttons C-F for Gears/Misc, Maybe 'Logo Up/Down' for 'Servo_Arm Up/Down'</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest_Note_1_quest_Show_String_For_Note_Small_Func" id="v;CN(?onO^,Qo5Rdkl1V"><value name="textStrIn"><shadow type="text" id="mC415@.d[bH+*y|Qf%wD"><field name="TEXT">'Rotatedisplay' could be used on Bot's Led_Screen, but causes light flickering on bottom row, so maybe avoid</field></shadow></value><next><block type="quest